OL,3,GNEWSA'We see each other and we
OL,4,Acelebrate that together'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We see each other, we're seen by each
OL,7,Fother and we celebrate that together,"
OL,8,Fan attendee of a Pride event has told
OL,9,Fthe BBC.
OL,11,FChannel Islands Pride has returned for
OL,12,Fits tenth year and Oli Davies, trustee
OL,13,Fof equality charity Liberate, said it
OL,14,Fhad become one of the biggest community
OL,15,Fevents in Guernsey's calendar. "It's
OL,16,Fabout people feeling safe, seen and
OL,17,Fknowing they belong," Davies said.
OL,19,FCouple Becca and Freddy Morris said the
OL,20,Fevent had played a "significant part"
OL,21,Fin their lives - getting married on the
OL,22,FChannel Islands Pride stage in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
