OL,3,GNEWSA'We see each other and we
OL,4,Acelebrate that together'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBecca said: "It was incredible. Seeing
OL,7,Fso many people that we loved there, and
OL,8,Fthe community celebrating with us, was
OL,9,Fjust beautiful."
